Package: FOStutorials
Title: Learnr Tutorials for Multivariate Data Analysis in the LUMC FOS
    Course
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rico", "Derks", , "r.j.e.derks@lumc.nl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Aswin", "Verhoeven", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Interactive learnr tutorials used in the class Multivariate
    Data Analysis of the FOS course of the LUMC. The tutorials cover
    principal component analysis (PCA) on the iris and food data sets, and
    PCA, PCA-class and PLS-DA on an NMR metabolomics data set.
